.convex

# Agent session artifacts and parked worktrees. Ignoring them globally is not
# enough: the Tailwind oxide scanner disables global git excludes and reads only
# repository .gitignore files, so without these lines every scratch file joins
# the CSS source scan (measured 240k files / 43 s instead of 3k / 0.6 s, which
# starved the Vite SSR module runner). scripts/tailwind-source-scan.test.ts guards it.
# Root-anchored like .prettierignore: a nested src/lib/scratch is source.
/scratch/
/.claude/worktrees/

# Orchestration marker files written by worktree provisioning; must never be committed
.worktree-ready